        "html": "<h2>Checklist para dominar el módulo</h2><div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><tr><th>Tema</th><th>Check</th></tr><tr><td class=\"speak-cell\">Describir tipos de empresas</td><td class=\"speak-cell\">[  ]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"speak-cell\">Diferenciar product y service</td><td class=\"speak-cell\">[  ]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"speak-cell\">Usar produce/provide/sell/export/import/buy/develop/employ</td><td class=\"speak-cell\">[  ]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"speak-cell\">Usar Present Simple afirmativo</td><td class=\"speak-cell\">[  ]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"speak-cell\">Usar don't y doesn't</td><td class=\"speak-cell\">[  ]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"speak-cell\">Hacer preguntas con do y does</td><td class=\"speak-cell\">[  ]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"speak-cell\">Responder con short answers</td><td class=\"speak-cell\">[  ]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"speak-cell\">Decir teléfonos, precios, años y cantidades</td><td class=\"speak-cell\">[  ]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"speak-cell\">Hacer una reserva o pedido por teléfono</td><td class=\"speak-cell\">[  ]</td></tr><tr><td class=\"speak-cell\">Presentar el perfil de una empresa</td><td class=\"speak-cell\">[  ]</td></tr></table></div>"
